WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.599
Make it punchier is hard to edit.

00:00:02.599 --> 00:00:07.796
Useful video feedback names the clip, the version, the timecode, and the exact change.

00:00:07.796 --> 00:00:12.622
We built a free tool to put those details in one review sheet.

00:00:12.972 --> 00:00:15.085
Here is a fictional example.

00:00:15.085 --> 00:00:23.112
For clip one, version one, at three seconds, remove the greeting and open with the phone ordering close up.

00:00:23.112 --> 00:00:28.604
Add each request separately, and choose one person to resolve conflicting team notes.

00:00:28.954 --> 00:00:32.923
Then copy the sheet or download it as a text file.

00:00:32.923 --> 00:00:36.171
Send it through the feedback channel you already use.

00:00:36.171 --> 00:00:37.975
No signup or video upload.

00:00:37.975 --> 00:00:44.831
Try ZERO Revision Notes through the link in the description, and tell us what would make it more useful.
